# ALLIANCE. New Forever dungeon. Source: foreverchanges.pro/dungeons/the-drowned-city and quest pages (level range is
# Blizzard's; the page says nobody had run it when it was written). Only Krazek's position is published.
@dungeon The Drowned City
@levels 35-40
@window 35-42
@best 37
@hub Stranglethorn Vale, 27.6, 77.5, 5
@entrance none
A 95789 @ Stranglethorn Vale, 27.0, 77.2 | Krazek in Booty Bay. 10 Voodoo-Infused Artifacts from the Saltseer pirates inside. He should also have The Saltseer Captain.
RUN @ Stranglethorn Vale, 21, 28 | New Forever dungeon, not checked in game yet. Its entrance is reported under water at about 21, 28 on the Stranglethorn Vale map, in the sea due west of Grom'gol Base Camp. No boat or flight path goes there: fly to Booty Bay and swim. Krazek in Booty Bay (27.0, 77.2) gives Shady Saltseers and The Saltseer Captain. Archmage Timear in Dalaran (Alterac Mountains 16.2, 71.7) gives Ancient Gurubashi Secrets. Loremaster Dibbs in Southshore (Hillsbrad Foothills 50.6, 57.1) is listed for Magics of the Drowned City and Take Two With Water; one source starts Take Two With Water at the Rebel Camp instead, after Troll Witchery. Take whatever else is offered for it: the addon logs it so these steps can be filled in.
